				<wikidot:authorName>TheMightyMcB</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4483018</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The smelting wouldn't kill them, no. It would stop the production of more clockwork though, since there wouldn't be any flesh left to convert. The thing about end of death is that your brain never stops. Even if I blended it up into a paste, your neurons would still be firing like crazy!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
