				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12366025#post-4335993</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12366025/package-dxv-180294-217#post-4335993</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 20 Aug 2019 20:22:33 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>TheMightyMcB</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4483018</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>It bleeds! It breathes!</p> <p>What stands before us, is not a machine<br /> It breathes, it will bleed and it will dream!</p> <p>Its body is covered in hundreds of wires.<br /> and a mouth that attempts to speak, it attempts to lie<br /> Only murmurs, collapse from its jaws.</p> <p>~ Entombment of a Machine - Job For A Cowboy</p> </blockquote> <p>Hope y'all enjoy our little contribution to a world without death. This has been a lot of fun to write, and it's been super cool working with Cranky on this one.</p> <p>Many thanks as well to our critters:<br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3440103&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578948046" alt="Captain Kirby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3440103)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" >Captain Kirby</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1956625&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578948046" alt="DrChandra" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1956625)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" >DrChandra</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4022320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578948046" alt="RockTeethMothEyes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4022320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" >RockTeethMothEyes</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/natvoltaic" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2800867&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578948046" alt="NatVoltaic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2800867)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/natvoltaic" >NatVoltaic</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thebluehour" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4078000&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1578948046" alt="TheBlueHour" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4078000)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thebluehour" >TheBlueHour</a></span>. We could not have done this without you guys.</p> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/themightymcb-s-author-page">Click Here</a> for more stuff by me!</strong></p> </div> 
